# CVE-2025-68121: crypto/tls incorrect certificate validation in Go <1.24.13.
# Affected binary: opt/quarto/bin/tools/x86_64/esbuild (bundled inside Quarto 1.9.38).
# esbuild is a vendored JS bundler invoked by Quarto at render time; it does not
# serve or initiate TLS connections in our usage. We cannot upgrade it independently
# of Quarto, and 1.9.38 is the latest Quarto release as of 2026-06.
# Re-evaluate when a newer Quarto release ships esbuild compiled with Go >=1.24.13.
CVE-2025-68121
